-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$1.4/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$13.65/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$17.06/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>Redwood</b> tree is one of the various trees that can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>. It appears as a very tall tree with a deep rustic red trunk and dark green colored leaves. It takes roughly a dozen swings to take down the Redwood by the base via a <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">refined axe</a>. Because of effort involved into procuring the tree and it's subpar payout, its usually used for construction projects that utilize the reddish wood that the tree offers. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The Redwood Tree is most common behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Ook_Lake\" title=\"Ook Lake\">Ook Lake</a>  \n</p><p>Like every other material in-game, it can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Tallest tree in-game.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; pa